  "details": "Hi! I had this idea because I was with my friend after we set up specific toggles for these highly customizable avatars and they go between a lot of different toggles, and it's a pain to manally change them every time. I think it'd be a very useful integration of the looks feature outside of just accessories to save toggles. It would add a lot of quality of life to the avatar experience and I think it'd be a good idea to at least consider for the game!",
